# Install __THEME_TITLE__

Package: `__THEME_NAME__`  
Version: `__THEME_VERSION__`  
Tagline: __THEME_TAGLINE__  
Class: `__THEME_CLASS__`

---

## Compatibility
- Target APEX: Oracle APEX 26.1.x or 26.2.x
- Target Theme: Universal Theme (theme 42)
- Target Base Theme: `ut-26.1` (APEX 26.1) or `ut-26.2` (APEX 26.2)
- Theme Style: **Iris** (light) only
- Fonts: declared package WOFF2 fonts, otherwise the Universal Theme system font stack

---

## Package contents and checksums
Verify the integrity of package contents before installation:

```bash
sha256sum -c checksums.sha256          # Linux
shasum -a 256 -c checksums.sha256      # macOS
```

On Windows, compare `Get-FileHash <file>` with the values in `checksums.sha256`. The installer also checks every file each time it runs.

This package includes:
- `theme.json`: Manifest describing metadata, compatibility, and optional fonts
- `theme.css`: Standalone scoped CSS bundle for `__THEME_NAME__`
- `theme-factory-runtime.js`: Switcher and client runtime helper
- `install.sh` / `uninstall.sh` / `restore.sh`: Installer scripts for Linux and macOS
- `install.ps1` / `uninstall.ps1` / `restore.ps1`: The same scripts for Windows PowerShell
- `preview/cover.jpg`: Theme visual preview
- `licenses/`: Applicable software and font licenses

